[node name="Prose1" parent="Panel" unique_id=250299459 instance=ExtResource("3_w404y")]
layout_mode = 0
theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 11
text = "The house that you noticed on your way home might more accurately be described as a mansion. Last week, it would have been a sight to see: three stories of brick-faced victorian-style opulence, including a grand pillared entrance and a turret. An iron fence rings the property that takes up a quarter of the block, with a wide gate that bars the way to the house and its accompanying two-car garage. Or, it would have, if it wasn't smashed open.

You step over the half of the expensive gate laying in the concrete driveway and approach the house. It seems quiet enough, but the front door has been left open. Like everywhere else, the lights are off.

The guidebook says to take whatever you need. You reckon that these people had plenty you can take. 

Inside, you're greeted by a foyer with a wide staircase leading up and away. Besides that, you can see a living area and a kitchen. 
"
autowrap_mode = 3
metadata/SetAsOverrideLabel = ""
metadata/ShowOnVar = ""
metadata/HideOnVar = ""

[node name="Prose5" parent="Panel" unique_id=21667827 instance=ExtResource("3_w404y")]
visible = false
layout_mode = 0
text = "Though the fridge is unpowered and the contents are thoroughly rotted, the pantry is well-stocked. You can't take anything that needs reconstituting, as your water is in limited supply already, but theres plenty of canned food that can be eaten raw. You stuff your backpack full.

+6 SUPPLIES"
autowrap_mode = 3
metadata/SetAsOverrideLabel = ""
metadata/ShowOnVar = ""
metadata/HideOnVar = ""

[node name="Prose6" parent="Panel" unique_id=674807768 instance=ExtResource("3_w404y")]
visible = false
layout_mode = 0
text = "The television is pushed to the side, as is the couch, opening up what must have once been a well decorated room. In the new space, the owners - or somebody else - has arranged a set of folding chairs a circle. It feels ritualistic and uncanny, and you're about to leave until you notice the handgun sitting at the center."
autowrap_mode = 3
metadata/SetAsOverrideLabel = ""
metadata/ShowOnVar = ""
metadata/HideOnVar = ""

[node name="Prose7" parent="Panel" unique_id=318561220 instance=ExtResource("3_w404y")]
visible = false
layout_mode = 0
text = "You step into the cicle and pick it up, only to discover that it's nothing more than a painted plastic toy. Feeling cheated, you look around, almost expecting a prankster to jump out any minute. Nothing happens. "
autowrap_mode = 3
metadata/SetAsOverrideLabel = ""
metadata/ShowOnVar = ""
metadata/HideOnVar = ""

[node name="Prose8" parent="Panel" unique_id=778814116 instance=ExtResource("3_w404y")]
visible = false
layout_mode = 0
text = "Even though the chairs are empty, each one of them faces perfectly towards you. "
metadata/SetAsOverrideLabel = ""
metadata/ShowOnVar = ""
metadata/HideOnVar = ""

[node name="Prose9" parent="Panel" unique_id=661333451 instance=ExtResource("3_w404y")]
visible = false
layout_mode = 0
text = "The guidebook warned you about people like this. You put the toy gun back down and hurry out of the circle of chairs. "
metadata/SetAsOverrideLabel = ""
metadata/ShowOnVar = ""
metadata/HideOnVar = ""

[node name="Prose10" parent="Panel" unique_id=1092892985 instance=ExtResource("3_w404y")]
visible = false
layout_mode = 0
text = "Most of the bedrooms are unremarkable, full of twin beds and scattered toys. The gun safe in the master bedroom catches your eye, though. It's been left open."
autowrap_mode = 3
metadata/SetAsOverrideLabel = ""
metadata/ShowOnVar = ""
metadata/HideOnVar = ""

[node name="Prose11" parent="Panel" unique_id=2004714508 instance=ExtResource("3_w404y")]
visible = false
layout_mode = 0
text = "Most of the calibers are useless to you, and it seems the long guns have all been taken. You gather what ammunition you can use.

+2 AMMUNITION"
metadata/SetAsOverrideLabel = ""
metadata/ShowOnVar = ""
metadata/HideOnVar = ""

[node name="Prose12" parent="Panel" unique_id=1099131030 instance=ExtResource("3_w404y")]
visible = false
layout_mode = 0
text = "On your way home, you notice that someone's set up a pile of crates in a nearby park. The guidebook says it's too dark to check it out now. It'll have to wait.

+LOC_15_public_park"
autowrap_mode = 3
metadata/SetAsOverrideLabel = ""
metadata/ShowOnVar = ""
metadata/HideOnVar = ""

